{
    "title": "The Tiger",
    "description": "Explore the wild jungle as a powerful tiger! This visually stunning RPG will let you develop your character and upgrade your skills to become the strongest cat out there. Try your skills in one of two modes: CO-OP or PVP - everything in Online Real-Time Multiplayer. Play with people from all over the World!\r\n\r\nOnline Real-Time Multiplayer RPG\r\nStunning 3D graphics\r\nBeautiful environment\r\nRealistic animals\r\nCharacter development and upgrades\r\nCooperative multiplayer hunting and PVP Battle Arena modes\r\nClans system with Global Rankings\r\nSmooth performance\r\n\r\n\r\nONLINE MULTIPLAYER SIMULATOR\r\n\r\nMeet other tigers in real time and conquer the jungles and forests! With them or against them - it\u2019s up to you, but you\u2019re never alone in the wilderness. Join players from all around the World!\r\n\r\nCHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION\r\n\r\nCreate your own tiger! Choose your favorite - the Asian Tiger? White Tiger? Or maybe the rare Gold Tiger? Whichever reflects your character the best - it\u2019s all up to you!\r\n\r\nRPG SYSTEM\r\n\r\nDecide which attributes to develop and which skills to upgrade to become the strongest out there! Make your progres even faster by completing daily quests. Choose wisely, because you\u2019re the king of your own destiny!\r\n\r\nAMAZING GRAPHICS\r\n\r\nStarting from your den all the way to the depths of the forest, the high-end graphics will leave you amazed. Chase the realistic animals and enjoy the beautiful environment!\r\n\r\nVARIOUS GAME MODES\r\n\r\nChoose your gameplay style! The hunting mode lets you cooperate with other players and search for bigger prey together. If you need more, try yourself in the PVP mode and fight against a team of enemy tigers. Be prepared for tough battles!\r\n\r\nBECOME KING OF THE JUNGLE\r\n\r\nBecome the strongest one and achieve the highest rank as you can! Earn Combat Points by developing your character. Compete with other players and make your way to the podium of Global Rankings!\r\n\r\nDEMONSTRATE YOUR LEADERSHIP\r\n\r\nCreate your own Clan and lead it to victory! Join the Weekly Bounty challenge together to make your members stronger. Compete with other Clans and show them your domination!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Explore the wild jungle as a powerful tiger! This visually stunning RPG will let you develop your character and upgrade your skills to become the strongest cat out there. Try your skills in one of two modes: CO-OP or PVP - everything in Online Real-Time Multiplayer. Play with people from all over the World!<br><br>Online Real-Time Multiplayer RPG<br>Stunning 3D graphics<br>Beautiful environment<br>Realistic animals<br>Character development and upgrades<br>Cooperative multiplayer hunting and PVP Battle Arena modes<br>Clans system with Global Rankings<br>Smooth performance<br><br><br>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER SIMULATOR<br><br>Meet other tigers in real time and conquer the jungles and forests! With them or against them - it\u2019s up to you, but you\u2019re never alone in the wilderness. Join players from all around the World!<br><br>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION<br><br>Create your own tiger! Choose your favorite - the Asian Tiger? White Tiger? Or maybe the rare Gold Tiger? Whichever reflects your character the best - it\u2019s all up to you!<br><br>RPG SYSTEM<br><br>Decide which attributes to develop and which skills to upgrade to become the strongest out there! Make your progres even faster by completing daily quests. Choose wisely, because you\u2019re the king of your own destiny!<br><br>AMAZING GRAPHICS<br><br>Starting from your den all the way to the depths of the forest, the high-end graphics will leave you amazed. Chase the realistic animals and enjoy the beautiful environment!<br><br>VARIOUS GAME MODES<br><br>Choose your gameplay style! The hunting mode lets you cooperate with other players and search for bigger prey together. If you need more, try yourself in the PVP mode and fight against a team of enemy tigers. Be prepared for tough battles!<br><br>BECOME KING OF THE JUNGLE<br><br>Become the strongest one and achieve the highest rank as you can! Earn Combat Points by developing your character. Compete with other players and make your way to the podium of Global Rankings!<br><br>DEMONSTRATE YOUR LEADERSHIP<br><br>Create your own Clan and lead it to victory! Join the Weekly Bounty challenge together to make your members stronger. Compete with other Clans and show them your domination!",
